{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S11把“对方也许需要他”写得较为确定，S12又补入“让对方安心”，比X更容易把人物尚未确定的动机说满。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的纵向交替和【】重点让视线能迅速抓住每段主轴，感受词又按音乐节点出现，减少了一屏同时堆满短词的负担。水波、船、摇荡、靠岸等反复出现的意象，也把情绪变化和音乐进程连成了一条线，感受比X更细腻具体。不过，X的因果解释更克制、完整，人物为什么收住、为什么转念交代得更准确，不容易被额外推断带偏。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cd36ddf5-cb3b-4c33-a317-4a35872a5e83", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053434202203Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:35:46.223110+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6c89ef42237caaf72fbe9b9fd48d7bfb83fc1f6d8f7c1420d53e23dec5b4497e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000